  {
   "id": "away-the-survival-series-71457@1.05",
   "gameId": "away-the-survival-series-71457",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.05",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-10-08T22:31:54.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’d like to apologize for the major bugs that some players have encountered at launch. We are serious about addressing these issues and have begun working on (and even fixed) many of them already.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As a small indie shipping our first game, we decided to launch on multiple platforms and in multiple languages. This should not have been done at the expense of our game’s quality and experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Over the past 5 years, our small team has put our hearts and souls into creating this game. We want it to be the best experience it can be. We are going to continue listening to you and making improvements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Our sole focus right now is bug fixes and making game improvements. We’ve been working long hours to push patches as quickly as we can. If you are experiencing any bugs, or just want to share some feedback with us, you can make a report here. It will be sent straight to the dev team for review. We’d like to extend a big thanks to everyone who’s filled out the form already, you have helped us make a better game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can expect more patches and fixes in the weeks and months to come.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Our latest patch takes care of the following",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed respawn bugs and broken animation/control",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved sound and music",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved collisions and dynamics",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved setting controls, and saving",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improve statistics, skills, and achievements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Polished various missions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Other minor stability, guidance, and cosmetic improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Exploration Mode enters Beta: We have decided to denote Exploration Mode as a Beta thanks to your feedback. We have improvements in mind that we will begin experimenting with over the months to come.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
